{"id":"719296019c11ec36","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness.md","title":"可递归真理理论的不完全性","display":"cor-truth-theory-incompleteness — 可递归真理理论的不完全性","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","aliases":["91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","91-cor-truth-incomplete","91-cor-Godel-truth"],"display":"cor-truth-theory-incompleteness — 可递归真理理论的不完全性","depends_on":["[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness</span><span>91-cor-truth-incomplete</span><span>91-cor-Godel-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-theory-incompleteness — 可递归真理理论的不完全性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecAx}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{RecAx}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> 可递归公理化)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (理论包含足够的基础算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> (理论对标准自然数模型算术可靠)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span> (理论句法一致)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (算术句子集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{RecAx}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\n\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\varphi\n\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\ \\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{RecAx}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\n\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\varphi\n\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\ \\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结论使用 Gödel–Rosser 不完全性与第二不完备定理。可递归公理化、足够\n算术和一致性是应用这些定理的结构前提；加入算术可靠性后，可把独立句\n选成在标准模型中为真的句子。</p>\n<p>这不是 Tarski 不可定义定理的直接推论，也不适用于任意不可递归的\n“真理理论”：例如把全部真算术句作为公理会失去可递归公理化前提。\n若要把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\varphi\\)</span> 加强成\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>，还必须另加适当的\nT-out 或去引号原则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecAx}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{RecAx}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm Q\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\n\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\varphi\n\\land\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land\\ \\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal T_T)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T\\nvdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":2016,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9c2daf67c9f2e7b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["41fdad0bfaff0bf5","4e50c115b0d32044"]}